Is it possible to get cummulative row sums [NT] with ddply.

The example could be

ID	Year
A	2000
A	2000
A	2000
A	2008
A	2009
B	2001
B	2001
B	2001
C	2008
C	2009
C	2009
D	2008
D	2009
D	2009

to achieve something like

ID	Year	N	NT
A	2000	3	3
A	2008	1	4
A	2009	1	5
B	2001	3	3
C	2008	1	1
C	2009	2	3
D	2008	1	1
D	2009	2	3

